## Bundled Documentation Site Assets

The following compiled asset is committed to the repository and served
directly to end users as part of the built documentation site.

25. Tailwind CSS (https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss)
    Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc.
    License: MIT; text in `LICENSES/MIT.txt`
    Used for: Utility-class CSS compiled into `docs/assets/css/zenzic-tailwind.min.css`
    by a human-run Tailwind CLI build (see `docs/assets/css/README.md`); the compiled
    file carries its own inline `/*! tailwindcss ... | MIT License | ... */` banner.
    The bundle is Tailwind's theme and utility CSS (MIT) selected and parameterised
    by this project's input (`tailwind-input.css`: the dark-mode variant selector,
    and the arbitrary values used in the site's markup), which is Apache-2.0; its
    `.license` file declares both.

